  "body": "## Changelog\n* 82a88c54431d9c93d7eedad87ddf82cc526bc110 INS-2933: Add publish to orb back to pluto (#623)\n* 9b1713b988322b178888e9738795d2473ade194b INS-3141: Fix CVE-2026-111943 for pluto (#629)\n* d7d4f3f312f5b65c989a5a4eb92eb6b4ef86e29f Managed by Terraform\n* aef4f6d6a7479108475e215dbaa24e5399482980 Managed by Terraform\n* 9495152d614581a988e31414fa64e8b82474d956 Managed by Terraform\n\nYou can verify the signatures of both the checksums.txt file and the published docker images using [cosign](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign).\n\n```bash\ncosign verify-blob checksums.txt --bundle=checksums.txt.sigstore.json --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n```bash\ncosign verify us-docker.pkg.dev/fairwinds-ops/oss/pluto:v5.24.5 --key https://artifacts.fairwinds.com/cosign-p256.pub\n```\n\n"
